-- title:
--   Exact original purejump stopped compensated HJB reward gap has arbitrarily small positive-part L1 after compact spatial cutoff
-- statement:
--   For every epsilon>0 under the exact original sigma=0 stopped reserve/payments/ruin conventions, choose one interior smooth band and small negative jump cutoff so that the positive part of original G minus w(x) minus the actual compensated J, generator drift B, and finite cutoff linear martingale L is integrable and has expectation at most epsilon/2. This is the genuine stochastic positive-gap estimate, without assuming source80 or the root theorem.
-- source:
--   Original Avram-Palmowski-Pistorius 2007 Proposition 4(i), compensated negative-jump Ito and spatial-localisation step. The exact stochastic estimate is independent of source80; use separately proved positive-part envelope algebra to recover physical signed witnesses.

import Mathlib
